{"annotations":{"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Check a list of coins"},"description":"Checks up to 50 tokens in one call and sorts them into three groups: with_unlocks (an unlock is scheduled within the window, nearest first), without_unlocks (we track the token and nothing is scheduled within the window) and unknown (the token is not in our data: this is NOT evidence that it has no unlocks). Use when the user gives a portfolio, a watchlist or several tickers ('I hold ARB, OP and SUI, any unlocks coming?'). Matching is exact on ticker, slug or name; an input that only partly matches goes to unknown with did_you_mean instead of a guess. Send tickers only: amounts and wallet addresses are not needed and not accepted. portfolio_page opens the same list on the website. For full details of one coin call get_token_unlocks; disputed=true on an unlock means the project's documents differ, report both versions.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"days":{"default":30,"description":"Look-ahead window in days.","maximum":60,"minimum":1,"type":"number"},"lang":{"default":"en","description":"Language of the page links.","enum":["en","ru"],"type":"string"},"min_strength":{"default":"small","description":"Lowest strength that counts as an unlock to report.","enum":["strong","medium","small"],"type":"string"},"tokens":{"description":"Tickers (preferred), names or slugs, for example [\"ARB\",\"OP\",\"sui\"].","items":{"maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["tokens"],"type":"object"},"name":"check_portfolio","outputSchema":{"properties":{"data_updated_utc":{"type":["string","null"]},"license":{"type":["string","null"]},"limits_note":{"type":"string"},"note":{"type":"string"},"portfolio_page":{"type":"string"},"requested":{"type":"number"},"source":{"type":"string"},"summary":{"type":"object"},"track_record_strong":{"type":["string","null"]},"unknown":{"items":{"properties":{"did_y